gent/component (e.g., web server, proxy, browser, etc.), but it does not neutralize or incorrectly neutralizes CR and LF characters before the data is included in outgoing HTTP headers."},"defaultConfiguration":{"level":"none"}},{"id":"117","guid":"e4360770-eb15-55cf-8880-7051868a1961","shortDescription":{"text":"Improper Output Neutralization for Logs"},"fullDescription":{"text":"The product does not neutralize or incorrectly neutralizes output that is written to logs."},"defaultConfiguration":{"level":"warning"}},{"id":"176","guid":"caae0840-1583-5ad6-9822-3d01b325b926","shortDescription":{"text":"Improper Handling of Unicode Encoding"},"fullDescription":{"text":"The product does not properly handle when an input contains Unicode encoding."},"defaultConfiguration":{"level":"none"}},{"id":"330","guid":"80cf7ee1-5a29-5fb4-a2f1-701272abf9b7","shortDescription":{"text":"Use of Insufficiently Random Values"},"fullDescription":{"text":"The product uses insufficiently random numbers or values in a security context that depends on unpredictable numbers."},"defaultConfiguration":{"level":"error"}},{"id":"352","guid":"4cccead0-b8dc-5b81-98f4-9b2b99290363","shortDescription":{"text":"Cross-Site Request Forgery (CSRF)"},"fullDescription":{"text":"The web application does not, or can not, sufficiently verify whether a well-formed, valid, consistent request was intentionally provided by the user who submitted the request."},"defaultConfiguration":{"level":"warning"}},{"id":"374","guid":"2275aa67-8872-5cf8-b261-4835437b1a69","shortDescription":{"text":"Passing Mutable Objects to an Untrusted Method"},"fullDescription":{"text":"The product sends non-cloned mutable data as an argument to a method or function."},"defaultConfiguration":{"level":"warning"}},{"id":"397","guid":"df1b81a3-8f32-5924-8f6d-2ce3ae1bb9c7","shortDescription":{"text":"Declaration of Throws for Generic Exception"},"fullDescription":{"text":"Throwing overly broad exceptions promotes complex error handling code that is more likely to contain security vulnerabilities."},"defaultConfiguration":{"level":"none"}},{"id":"563","guid":"9a63821a-d035-5c3f-baa7-c6c0f6b6f67f","shortDescription":{"text":"Assignment to Variable without Use"},"fullDescription":{"text":"The variable\u0027s value is assigned but never used, making it a dead store."},"defaultConfiguration":{"level":"none"}},{"id":"89","guid":"ef952f10-a202-504c-8649-9ffcb2291d69","shortDescription":{"text":"Improper Neutralization of Special Elements used in an SQL Command (\u0027SQL Injection\u0027)"},"fullDescription":{"text":"The product constructs all or part of an SQL command using externally-influenced input from an upstream component, but it does not neutralize or incorrectly neutralizes special elements that could modify the intended SQL command when it is sent to a downstream component."},"defaultConfiguration":{"level":"error"}}]}]}]}